<title>USA: AMBAC qualifies five issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>AMBAC qualifies five issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Indemnity Corp said on Thursday that it qualified five issues for bond insurance slated for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Alaska Municipal Bond Bank, $1.605 million of general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--Cotati-Rohnert Park, Calif., $9 million of GOs.</p>
<p>--Lowell, Mass, $44 million of GOs.</p>
<p>--Brockport Central School District, N.Y., $3.130 of bonds.</p>
<p>--Chesterfield County, S.C., $2.4 million of GOs.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
